# Directories excluded from the graphify knowledge graph.
#
# docs/superpowers/ is 113 files / 5.36 MB of historical plans and specs -- 84%
# of this repo's markdown. They describe designs as they were PROPOSED, which is
# often not how they shipped. Indexing them makes superseded designs compete with
# current ones in query results, and would push ~1.35M tokens through a serial
# backend for the privilege.
docs/superpowers/

# .superpowers/ is agent scratch (plans, reports) that grows every session -- already
# 1200+ files / 35 MB, several times the volume of docs/superpowers/ above, and rising.
# (Deliberately not stating an exact count: it would be stale within a session.)
# It is otherwise kept out of the graph only by
# .git/info/exclude, which is machine-local and does not travel with the repo; this
# tracked entry is what actually guarantees exclusion for every clone.
.superpowers/

# Test and eval fixtures: synthetic content, not architecture.
tests/fixtures/
evals/fixtures/

# Build output and generated reports.
site/
output/
